# Echoes of Resonance — Cursor index exclusions (Angular + ASP.NET Core)
# Keep in sync with .gitignore where practical; goal is less noise for AI context.

# --- Angular / Node (frontend) ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/out-tsc/
**/.sass-cache/
**/coverage/
**/__screenshots__/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- .NET / Visual Studio (backend) ---
**/[Bb]in/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Dd]ebug/
**/[Rr]elease/
**/[Bb]uild/
**/[Ll]og/
**/[Ll]ogs/
.vs/
**/.vs/
artifacts/
.artifacts/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.tmp
*.log
*.binlog
TestResults/
**/[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# --- Local databases & secrets ---
*.db
*.db-*
*.mdf
*.ldf
.env
.env.*

# --- OS & editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
**/.history/
